        "readme": "<p>This module demonstrates how Serenity/JS integrates with the legacy Protractor framework using Jasmine as the test runner.</p>\n<h2>Why this module?</h2>\n<p>Protractor has been deprecated, but Serenity/JS continues to support it to help teams migrate to Playwright or WebdriverIO at their own pace. The Screenplay Pattern abstractions remain portable across all supported tools.</p>\n<h2>Features demonstrated</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Passing and failing scenario reporting through Protractor&#39;s Jasmine integration</li>\n<li>Restarting browser between tests for test isolation</li>\n<li>Screenplay Pattern integration within Protractor/Jasmine tests</li>\n<li>Filtering tests using Jasmine&#39;s <code>grep</code> pattern</li>\n</ul>\n"
